.TH HERDSMAN-STOP 1 "" "herdsman" "herdsman manual"
.SH NAME
herdsman-stop \- End a route's sessions and service panes; the work stays on disk.
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
usage: herdsman stop <route> [--grace <seconds>] [-y] [--dry-run]

Asks each agent for its report, waits up to --grace seconds (default 120), then
closes the agent and service panes and retires the pair. Worktrees, branches,
the route folder and the inbox stay. A stopped route can be resumed.
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR herdsman (1)
